  "body": "91 The Esplanade & 17 Laurence Street, Manly, Auckland — To Be Sold Together.  A Family Legacy Secured for Over 50 Years — A Coastal Holding of Exceptional Size and Scale.   Offered to the market together for the first time in over half a century this is an exceptionally rare opportunity in one of Auckland’s most sought after seaside locations.\r\n\r\n91 The Esplanade & 17 Laurence Street, Manly, Auckland — (To Be Sold Together).  Combined Land Area: Approximately 2,024m² (approximately half an acre) Two adjoining Freehold titles | North facing Beachfront. The sections are approximately 1,012m² each.   This flat landholding extends from Laurence Street through to the golden sands of Big Manly Beach.\r\n\r\nThe property encompasses a Dodd Paterson designed pavilion style beachfront residence  at 91 The Esplanade and an original cottage with  small orchard at 17 Laurence Street.\r\n\r\n A Rare and Unique Coastal Setting\r\n\r\nThe property has been lived in permanently and as a holiday home, hosting family weddings, birthdays and Christmas celebrations.\r\n\r\nBeachfront Position\r\n\r\nThe Esplanade frontage opens directly onto Big Manly Beach with expansive views across the bay and out to the Hauraki Gulf.\r\n\r\n \r\nSpace & Privacy\r\n\r\nThe generous near flat land provides an exceptional setting for those seeking room to create, enjoy or preserve a significant family landholding.\r\n\r\n Future Potential\r\n\r\nThe Two title configuration offers flexibility for a future family estate, a landmark coastal residence or exploration of development possibilities subject to the relevant planning and consent requirements.\r\n\r\n Manly Lifestyle\r\n\r\nManly is a well established seaside location in North Auckland renowned for its sandy beach, swimming, boating and sailing. Manly Village is within easy walking distance providing cafés, restaurants, a superette, Medical Centre, Pharmacy and everyday amenities. The Manly Sailing Club, Lawn Bowls Club, Tennis Club, Manly Park and playground are all approximately a five minute walk away while Gulf Harbour Marina is only 10 minutes away. For boating enthusiasts the beach provides easy access to the Hauraki Gulf.\r\n\r\nThe property is approximately 40km from Auckland CBD and just over 60km from Auckland International Airport providing a rare combination of coastal lifestyle with easy accessibility to the city centre. For an alternative journey into the city the Gulf Harbour Ferry provides a scheduled passenger return service between Gulf Harbour and Auckland.\r\n\r\nThe instructions are clear, this legacy must be sold as our owners have new plans.\r\n\r\nDISCLAIMER  This listing comprises of two separate adjoining Freehold titles to be Sold Together.\r\n\r\nTitle  for 91 The Esplanade, Big Manly - Lot 33 DP 17816, Identifier NA615/268 Measuring 1,012m2 (More or Less)\r\n\r\nTitle for 17 Laurence Street,  Big Manly - Lot 46 DP 17816, Identifier NA802/189 Measuring 1,012m2 (More or Less)\r\n\r\nVendors Sales Condition : Both Titles are to be sold simutaneously under a single legal binding Sales and Purchase Agreement, Neither Property will be Sold Individually. \r\n\r\n\r\nFOR SALE BY TENDER\r\n\r\nTender Close Date : Wednesday 25th November 2026 (Not To Be Sold Prior)\r\n\r\nOPEN HOMES SATURDAY 12:00 - 12.45PM  AND PRIVATE VIEWINGS BY APPOINTMENT",
